{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花の名前教えてくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ハナニラ」ていうのか。\nよし、覚えとこう:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、昨日放送だった「日本くぎづけ大学」\n見てくださった方、感想ありがとうございました＊\nちゃんと出るって言わないでてごめんなさいでしたx("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驚いたことが沢山あった！\n沢山知ることできてよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全員で撮影がありました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん、まりか、まひろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃじゃぁん、\nこのメンツ意外"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼わおっ\nて思うかもしれんけども、仲よいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんとめっちゃ趣味合う♪\nお互いゆるロックバンド好きやから\nよくしゃべるっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"flumpoolやGalileo流して\n2人でエアギターするんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブとかフェス行きたいねー\nて話してる^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日生駒ちゃんにヘドバン教えてもらって、\nかなにアイドルダンス...オタ芸！\n教えてもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★わおっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうばっちりだぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなが今日「まりちゃに会いたかった」\nて言ってくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふ\nまりちゃもかなに会いたかったっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなには「まりちゃ」て呼ばれるの。\nかなにだけっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ、まりか、ねね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何してるのかわからん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、さりげなくおいシャンの衣装来てます..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ち時間とか1人動きまくってた。\nダンスとバレエ踊りまくった。\n体動かしたい気分だった:D笑\nまひろとかひめかとかちま巻き添えにしたけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね「元気だねぇ...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんか‼\nソファーでくつろいで、おばあちゃんかっっ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「ねねぇー遊ぼー⁇」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね「んもー、まりかは3番目くらいにめんどくさいねぇ...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「え"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...3番目なんか。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず伊藤ちゃんず安定"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"******\n全員が集まったの久しぶり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は選抜、アンダーでなかなか会えないことが多いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみんなそろったから、\n嬉しくて嬉しくてすごいはしゃいでしまったよ笑\nメンバーに会うと元気になるな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい、めっちゃめちゃ元気になる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スケジュールの差とか悔しいって思う。\n選抜メンバーと会うたび違いがわかります。\n仕事の経験もあるけどもアンダーよりも\n行動がきびきびしてて強くなってるのがわかります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会うたび刺激を受けます。\nもちろんアンダーどうしでも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜と一緒だったら、\n自分の頑張ってる感じとかちょっとした余裕な顔とか\n無意識に見せるようになったのが自分でもわかる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーだけの方が安心するとか、\nどこかで思ってたのかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焦りとかを隠したくて表で余裕ですよ。\nって言ってるような顔してたかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかっててもそう思ってしまうのが悔しい。\nそんな自分が嫌。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも絶対嫌な人間になりたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ弱いな。まだまだ自分に甘い。\n強くならなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しかったら悔しいって思えばいい。\n泣くなら泣けばいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれだけで終わらせない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中途半端なままでいたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンの絆は深いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーがだいすき^^\n今日、本当に嬉しかった。\n全員そろったの、本当に嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと深められるように\nみんなでもっともっと頑張りたい！です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レンズがありません:)\n右目が非常に悪いの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は授業中だけメガネだけど、\nそろそろコンタクトにしたいぃぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も元気に頑張りまりかよお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...不自然にずっと飛んでるけど疲れません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/9738741/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}